flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2167388Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2168335Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2168874Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2169696Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2171308Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2171873Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2172265Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2172969Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2173317Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2174001Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2175022Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2176132Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2176876Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2177853Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2178339Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2178924Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2179339Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2180114Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2180389Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2180616Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2180955Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2181525Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
