flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2185803Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-09T15:11:02.2186277Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
